  stats/com.sun.xml.ws/servlet/4.0.5/execution-metrics.json:44:        "If the generated tests attempt full end-to-end SOAP request dispatch (building a real SOAP envelope and asserting a response body), that pulls in more of the jaxws-rt runtime (already covered by the existing com.sun.xml.ws:jaxws-rt:4.0.5 metadata) and increases test complexity, but does not require new setup.",
